"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Accountant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Other Ministry/ Departments</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Accountant/ Junior Accountant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Department of Posts, Ministry of Communications</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Postal Assistant/ Sorting Assistant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Central Govt. Offices/ Ministries other than CSCS cadres.</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Senior Secretariat Assistant/ Upper Division Clerks</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Military Engineering Services, Ministry of Defence</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Senior Administrative Assistant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Central Board of Direct Taxes (CBDT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tax Assistant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs (CBIC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tax Assistant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.1488%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Central Bureau of Narcotics, Ministry of Finance</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.9831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub-Inspector </span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC CGL Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Statistical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have completed their&nbsp;Graduation degree in any stream with at least 60% marks in Mathematics at the 12th standard level, or they should have a Bachelor’s degree with Statistics as one of the subjects.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Statistical Investigator Grade-II<br>\n</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation in any stream with Statistics as one of the subjects from a recognized university</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All other Posts</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation in any stream from a recognized university will be eligible for the CGL Examination, 2026.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CGL Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://ssc.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the SSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for SSC CGL recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CGL Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-I Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>